  "evidencia": "Page: Lush (band). Sentence: Lush were an English rock band formed in London in 1987.\nPage: Lush (band). Sentence: The lineup before the original split consisted of Miki Berenyi (vocals, guitar), Emma Anderson (vocals, guitar), Phil King (bass) and Chris Acland (drums).\nPage: P.O.D.. Sentence: Payable on Death (abbreviated P.O.D.) is a Christian nu metal band formed in 1992 and based in San Diego, California.\nPage: P.O.D.. Sentence: The band's line-up consists of vocalist Sonny Sandoval, drummer Wuv Bernardo, guitarist Marcos Curiel, and bassist Traa Daniels.\nPage: Gala (album). Sentence: Gala is the debut compilation album by the English alternative rock band Lush, released in 1990 by 4AD as an introduction to the US and Japanese markets, comprising the band's earliest releases in reverse chronological order, plus two additional tracks.",
